<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Sherghati | Secure Relocation Bihar
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my bike from Sherghati using the IRCTC bike parcel service instead of a mover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, the IRCTC bike parcel service is available for long‑distance rail shipments, but it lacks the specialized hydraulic ramp trailers, 4‑layer cushioning, and real‑time GPS tracking that Shree Ashirwad provides. Our door‑to‑door solution ensures zero‑scratch handling, insurance coverage, and live monitoring, which rail parcels cannot guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for Bike Transportation In Sherghati to major cities?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, bike registration certificate, GST‑compliant invoice (if applicable), and a signed insurance declaration. Our team also prepares the e‑Way bill for interstate moves, ensuring compliance with IBA mover code and smooth customs clearance where required.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 4‑layer protective cushioning differ from standard bike wrapping?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 4‑layer system combines 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, and a final stretch‑film weatherproof layer. This multi‑stage barrier absorbs shocks, prevents moisture ingress, and guards against road vibrations, delivering a far higher protection level than single‑layer wraps used by generic movers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a guarantee that my bike will arrive without any scratches or dents?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We offer a Zero Transit Scratch Guarantee backed by our enclosed multi‑axle carriers, hydraulic loading ramps, and IRDAI‑approved full‑value insurance. If any damage occurs during transit, we cover repair costs up to the declared value, providing peace of mind for every Bike Transportation In Sherghati request.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the cost factors influencing Bike Transportation charges from Sherghati?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Charges are calculated based on distance (≈850 km to major hubs), bike dimensions, chosen insurance coverage, and any special handling such as customized wooden crating. Our transparent pricing breakdown includes fuel surcharge, driver allowance, and GST, ensuring no hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it travels from Sherghati to another city?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every shipment is equipped with a satellite GPS unit linked to our 24/7 monitoring center. You receive a live tracking link via SMS or email, allowing you to view the exact location of your bike parcel at any moment during the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you provide any additional services for high‑value or antique motorcycles?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For high‑value or vintage bikes we offer bespoke wooden crating, climate‑controlled storage, and optional on‑site supervision during loading and unloading. These premium services are covered under our full‑value insurance and are designed to meet the exacting standards of collectors and enthusiasts.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
